WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Luke uses raw Drive Rush after heavy Knuckle.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.750
Forward medium punch hits Ken on wake-up.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.700
Crouching heavy punch links after the Rush overhead.

4
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.850
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle starts the juggle.

5
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.850
Perfect light Flash Knuckle relaunches Ken.

6
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.800
Heavy Flash Knuckle knocks Ken down.
